{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24342","headline":"喜梦得自冯翊归洛兼呈令公 · 白居易","name":"喜梦得自冯翊归洛兼呈令公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上客新从左辅回，高阳兴助洛阳才。\n已将四海声名去，又占三春风景来。\n甲子等头怜共老，文章敌手莫相猜。\n邹枚未用争诗酒，且饮梁王贺喜杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}